{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，早前的信號設備故障已修復，港島綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。<br/>\n<br/>\n今早大約8時45分，港鐵表示，香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，港島綫列車服務一度受阻需要額外延長行車時間。<br/>\n<br/>\n至早上大約10時30分，港鐵人員完成修復，列車服務陸續恢復正常。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:04:34.169005+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:41:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:41.088330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:58:05.158352+00:00","content_hash":"c0163124ffa42582899d30ca27fb35c74553db7bc328b09426a115442b24e710","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}